WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.734 --> 00:00:02.734
-Guys, it's time to take a look
at the stories making headlines

00:00:02.734 --> 00:00:04.534
today with good with the bad.

00:00:04.534 --> 00:00:06.767
It's time for "Pros and Cons."
There you go.

00:00:06.767 --> 00:00:08.734
-♪ Pros and cons
and pros and cons ♪

00:00:08.734 --> 00:00:11.901
♪ And pros ♪

00:00:11.901 --> 00:00:14.033
-Tonight, we'll be taking
a look at the pros and cons

00:00:14.033 --> 00:00:16.601
of returning from the Olympics.

00:00:16.601 --> 00:00:18.601
The winter Olympics just wrapped
up in Beijing,

00:00:18.601 --> 00:00:19.968
and all the athletes
are headed home.

00:00:19.968 --> 00:00:21.501
So, let's take a look at the
pros and cons

00:00:21.501 --> 00:00:23.968
of returning home
from the Olympics.

00:00:23.968 --> 00:00:25.801
Here we go.
First one, pro.

00:00:25.801 --> 00:00:28.434
Everyone in your hometown will
want to talk to you.

00:00:28.434 --> 00:00:31.434
Con, everyone in your hometown
will want to talk to you.

00:00:31.434 --> 00:00:33.634
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:35.234 --> 00:00:39.100
Pro, telling your neighbor
you're a curling gold medalist.

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:41.200
Con, getting a text
the next day asking you

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:43.567
to sweep their driveway.
[ Applause ]

00:00:43.567 --> 00:00:45.234
-Come on.
-I'm used to it.

00:00:45.234 --> 00:00:47.367
-No respect.
-Pro, you just finished the most

00:00:47.367 --> 00:00:50.000
grueling feat of athleticism
in the world.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:52.434
Con, speed eating a Cinnabon
over a trash can

00:00:52.434 --> 00:00:54.000
in the Beijing airport.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:56.601
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:56.601 --> 00:00:58.501
We've all done it.
We've all done it.

00:00:58.501 --> 00:00:59.968
Can't just throw that out.
-No.

00:00:59.968 --> 00:01:01.434
-No, no, no.

00:01:01.434 --> 00:01:04.000
Pro, seeing your face
on the news.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:06.801
Con, with the headline,
"Olympian suffers frozen penis."

00:01:06.801 --> 00:01:08.734
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:08.734 --> 00:01:11.567
-Come on.

00:01:11.567 --> 00:01:12.934
The North Pole.

00:01:12.934 --> 00:01:14.634
-Um...

00:01:14.634 --> 00:01:17.234
[ Laughter ]

00:01:17.234 --> 00:01:19.934
Pro, telling your parents
that you're a gold medalist.

00:01:19.934 --> 00:01:21.501
Con, having your mom respond
by saying,

00:01:21.501 --> 00:01:23.367
"Well, your brother's a lawyer."

00:01:23.367 --> 00:01:27.801
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:27.801 --> 00:01:31.434
Pro, you were able to skate
three miles in six minutes.

00:01:31.434 --> 00:01:33.400
Con, now you have to watch
your uber eats driver

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:35.067
take an hour to drive
three blocks.

00:01:35.067 --> 00:01:37.133
You're like,
"I -- I can see you.

00:01:37.133 --> 00:01:40.067
Just stay there."
[ Applause ]

00:01:40.067 --> 00:01:42.667
Pro, training your whole life,
sacrificing so much,

00:01:42.667 --> 00:01:44.634
and representing your country.

00:01:44.634 --> 00:01:47.100
Con, finding out everyone
was watching "Euphoria" instead.

00:01:47.100 --> 00:01:49.400
That's not --
that's a big hit show.

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:52.567
[ Applause ]

00:01:52.567 --> 00:01:55.601
And finally, pro, feeling
the thrill of the 360 degree

00:01:55.601 --> 00:01:58.267
spin and flips through
the air on your snowboard.

00:01:58.267 --> 00:01:59.634
Con, feeling
the same thing on your

00:01:59.634 --> 00:02:01.300
flight home
on Spirit Airlines.

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:02.968
There you have it.
Those are the "Pros and Cons."

